{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791710100, "covers_from": "2026-10-11T09:15:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-11T09:16:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791710160, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-11T09:15:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37153, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "觀光", "content": "陽明山是值得好好開發的觀光景點。\n帶國外來的朋友，在這裡享受野菜，俯看大台北的景色。值得好好設計！", "display_name": "北投代表 Karen Lin", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T09:15:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53142, "sprite_key": "giraffe_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "其他", "content": "臺北市是怎麼了，道路，人行道雜草也不清（內湖西湖麗山街），整個很亂，高雄前站都比臺北乾淨", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.53,142", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T09:15:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 47252, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "教育", "content": "當個導師容易嗎？要找家長代表，打電話邀請家長的聲音，比電話客服都還要客氣上百倍. 希望業務回歸家長會", "display_name": "松山代表 No.47,252", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T09:15:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17225, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "8米以上巷道路面中間高兩邊低落差大，路邊畫綠色人行道是斜的，非常不舒服也不安全，要比照馬路做紅磚道", "display_name": "大安代表 周建隆", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 53142, "sprite_key": "giraffe_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.53,142", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 47252, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.47,252", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 17225, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 周建隆", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 61111, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display